title UC-E06: Issue Daily Emergency Report - Activity
|Supervisor|
start
:Open reports page;
:Select date;
|System|
:Count cases by category and status;
:Compute median arrival-to-assignment time;
if (Any activity?) then (yes)
  :Show summary;
  |Supervisor|
  if (Export PDF?) then (yes)
    |System|
